WEBVTT

00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:06.230
Several people witnessed a mysterious light over the Pacific coast

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:10.280
between Shikoku and Kyuushuu last night.

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:14.160
A few of them also reported hearing some sort of explosion.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.410
So it's been written it off as a meteor?

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:20.040
A surprising number of people are posting

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:22.750
that they wish a meteor would fall on them,

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:25.210
and end everything in an instant...

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:33.550
Mysterious Giant Meteor?

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:31.880
The largest solar flare in recorded history was also observed yesterday.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:32.880
Experts report that...

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:36.640
A large-scale solar flare?

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:41.060
Anyway, the question now is how we're going to deal with Hana's absence...

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:46.270
We don't have anybody else who can predict the enemy's actions.

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:48.360
If Hana knows that the enemy's about to move,

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:51.070
she will contact us.

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:55.660
I will stake my title of magical girl on it.

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:59.700
But if the enemy captures her first, it'll go badly.

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:02.370
That's right.

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:05.250
Hana successfully activated the <i>Blume</i>'s weaponry.

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:23.470
Once that information gets out, more people will come after her.

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:25.770
Captain...

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:28.860
Why didn't you stop Hana?

00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:32.820
Because...

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:33.820
Stay back!

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:36.200
Hana!

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:50.420
It's why I'm going to live in this town

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:57.550
I'm watching an endless dream

00:01:58.050 --> 00:02:04.020
Aren't you watching too?

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:11.360
It's always close by no matter how far away it seems

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:18.200
Can't you see it too?

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:23.700
The things you can't normally say

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:26.370
The things you try to express

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:28.870
The things you're willing to fight for

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:34.590
Standing on your own two feet

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:41.260
The night sky illuminates them all

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:48.390
The first flash of lightning

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:54.730
This is our battle to fight

00:02:55.400 --> 00:03:02.070
It's why I'm going to live in this town

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:10.580
This dream will absolutely come true

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:16.000
How much of its stored energy

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:19.170
did the <i>Blume</i> use up with that Orgone beam yesterday?

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:21.930
Alonzo is still making the final calculations.

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:27.180
I hope this doesn't prove detrimental to our plans.

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:31.390
It all worked out okay...

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:36.230
Most of the <i>Blume</i>'s energy should've been depleted after that attack yesterday.

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:41.570
We might have a problem if they repurposed the Livlaster as an energy source,

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:43.740
but only the princess can move it...

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:47.240
Energy is a problem for us, as well.

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:49.750
We need to get Lady Seiren here soon.

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:51.410
Yeah.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:53.670
What about the others?

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:55.380
Are they leaving all of this to us?

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:57.420
I don't know...

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:00.590
Everyone has their own thoughts on the matter, I'm sure.

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:09.770
Perhaps this planet has a strange effect on us...

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:18.570
Hey...

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:24.160
Can you use your singularity to locate Lady Seiren?

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:26.570
I can't.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:28.080
I don't know.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:36.540
True Self

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:39.500
The Planetary Gears' royal family

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:43.050
has the unique ability to manipulate Orgone energy.

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:46.840
Hana was created using the genetic matter of the royal family

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:49.470
specifically so that she could fire the Livlaster.

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:53.890
If Hana could fire the Livlaster she received,

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:57.060
she could've used the <i>Blume</i> as a weapon.

00:04:58.020 --> 00:05:02.690
All that matters now is finding Hana.

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:06.740
She's turned off her communicator, so she'll have to contact us.

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:07.280
But—

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:10.540
We're not going to solve anything by searching blindly.

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.540
We're worried, too.

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:22.460
Sorry.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:27.760
Where did you go, Hana?

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:41.940
Pitz?

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:49.120
Oh, there's another one?

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:50.700
You're right!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.290
They're so cute...

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:58.040
Oh, I remember you.

00:05:58.830 --> 00:05:59.960
Hello.

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:05.720
My...
Hello, there.

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:09.510
You're a painter?

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:12.220
I'm just a wanderer now.

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:13.760
I need money.

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:16.850
Pictures of Lappa sell surprisingly well.

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:20.560
A wanderer?

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:24.280
Are you alone today?

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:33.490
There's someone I want to be with forever...

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:38.040
But I suddenly felt afraid to be with him, so I ran away.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:41.830
I ran away, too.

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:46.630
The more you involve yourself with others, the scarier they can become.

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:51.140
I love to feel the wind.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:54.680
There are many wonderful things in this world.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:59.140
But relationships with people are just scary.

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:04.150
If you really try to get close to someone, you're going to get hurt.

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:05.980
No.

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:09.990
I can trust Daichi.

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:13.070
His name is Daichi?

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:32.470
Sir,

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:35.640
I've uploaded the data from Technology and Research Division 3

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:37.890
to your server, as you requested.

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:39.640
Thank you.

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:44.360
You don't have any plans tonight, do you, sir?

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:46.690
Would you like to have dinner, perhaps?

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:47.940
I must apologize.

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:51.400
I will be occupied with a private matter, tonight.

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:53.200
Shall we make plans another time?

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:55.320
Very well.

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:59.700
If you need anything, please call me.

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:00.500
Yes.

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:24.650
What is this?

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:30.110
The Machine Goodfellows have been active during every Kill-T-Gang attack.

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:35.410
How are the Orgone energy capsules and the Kill-T-Gangs related to one another?

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:48.670
This is Kube, right?

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:52.170
Mr. Kanda, is it?

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:55.130
I've been set up.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:56.930
But not by you.

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:57.890
Be careful.

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:33.920
Who are they?

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:36.130
If they find us, there'll be trouble.

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:38.680
Are they bad?

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:39.680
Yes.

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:42.520
Then we have to run!

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:43.060
Yeah!

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:50.520
A dead end...

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:57.200
Take care of Pitz.

00:09:57.660 --> 00:09:59.070
Um...

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:01.530
I can't get you involved in this.

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:02.160
Hide.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:08.960
Well, hello.

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:10.710
You seem to be doing well.

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:16.090
You running away has caused a great deal of trouble for us.

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:18.340
You do realize that, don't you?

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:21.010
Don't you, Princess?!

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:26.140
What is this thing?

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:28.810
Pitz!

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:29.940
Now!

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:36.990
Blume!

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:41.010
Eyecatch

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:47.330
Why do my problems only compound with every passing day?

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:49.000
You're a cold man,

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:53.040
refusing little Hitomi's offer like that.

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:55.710
I would never turn her down.

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:57.210
"I"?

00:10:57.840 --> 00:11:01.180
I wonder, who is this "I" you speak of?

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:04.680
I am detecting a degree of irritation in your voice.

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:07.310
It was you who told me

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:10.640
to allow Amara and Moco to conduct the testing of the Machine Goodfellows.

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:14.520
How are they related to the Kill-T-Gangs?

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:17.360
Was it you who tore Legacy from the sky?

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:21.320
Secrets are a necessary part of life,

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:25.160
although they do have a tendency to make things difficult...

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:27.750
What are you planning?

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:29.040
What are you after?

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:33.170
Something that will ease all your worries.

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:35.500
That is my desire.

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:42.050
Damned machine!

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:54.230
The emergency shutdown switch...

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:57.690
Did you really think that would work?

00:11:58.110 --> 00:12:01.900
You were such an easy man to control.

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:35.480
That's Hana's call sign!

00:12:36.310 --> 00:12:38.070
This is the Midsummer's Knights.

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:40.570
This is Mutou Hana...

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:42.190
Where are you right now?

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:43.900
I'm sorry. I don't know...

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:46.240
Don't turn off the power again.

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:47.530
I'll trace her signal!

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:49.240
Captain!

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:52.290
You heard him, didn't you?

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:54.500
Please don't turn your communicator off again.

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:57.670
Mutou Hana...

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:01.710
You're a member of a combat unit.

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:04.760
Obey your captain's orders.

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:07.090
I'm sorry.

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:11.060
There aren't any major Orgone energy movements today.

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:12.390
But...

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:14.350
But what?

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:17.060
Pitz is hurt.

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:20.940
We won't be able to predict the enemy's actions anymore.

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:23.030
Th-That's him.

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:26.070
What's wrong, Hana?

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:27.660
Amarok is here...

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:29.620
And Malkin was with him earlier!

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:31.740
It's dangerous for the captain to go alone...

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:32.370
I'll go, too!

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:36.080
Since there's no Orgone energy activity tonight, I'll go, too!

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:38.420
Wait, you two!

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:40.210
You contact the captain!

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:43.300
Jeez...

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:46.180
I'm the one he's after.

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:49.390
If you stay here, you'll be safe.

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:50.760
Thank you for everything.

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:06.490
Sir, I've brought tea.

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:12.160
Sir?

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:16.160
I can move... I can move.

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:30.430
They aren't following?

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:32.430
Hana!

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:38.890
Where are Amarok and Malkin?

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:41.520
They found me, but they didn't follow.

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:45.980
I'm glad...

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:49.950
I'm sorry.

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:51.320
I...

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:57.620
Daichi?

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:02.540
Who are you?

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:04.750
Lappa!

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:07.340
This won't take long.

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:11.970
Sir?

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:45.670
She's back!

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:47.590
Huh?

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:56.050
That was so sudden, it took me by surprise...

00:15:56.050 --> 00:16:00.100
My biggest worry is gone, and now I feel free.

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:05.110
This is the real me I've been waiting for.

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:09.070
Pac does not lie.

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:12.950
What is this?

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:14.280
Are they filming something?

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:15.700
Then where's the camera?

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:19.580
How does it feel to awaken to the real you?

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:23.170
We are the Planetary Gears.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:28.500
We reveal the world's dreams.

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:30.340
What?

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:31.380
How are they doing that?

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:35.640
Until a moment ago, you seemed to be with Blume.

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:38.510
That girl is Blume?

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:44.770
I need to hear more about this.

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:46.860
Understood.

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:48.900
The engine series is probably here.

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:50.610
Then...

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:55.660
We'll meet them in our Machine Goodfellows.

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:07.540
You knew about the real me?

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:12.300
When I heard you were made at the same time as the <i>Blume</i>,

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:13.380
I had a feeling.

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.470
It doesn't bother you?

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:20.640
You know how I feel now, right?

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:27.190
Don't keep your problems to yourself and get sad anymore, okay?

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:30.860
Yes, Captain.

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:31.480
And...

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:34.700
Thanks for saving Tanegashima.

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:40.120
It's kind of hard to go out there now.

00:17:40.780 --> 00:17:44.410
For the time being, there's no sign of Amarok or Malkin...

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:47.790
Captain! Look out!

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:49.840
Teppei?

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:51.380
They're coming!

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:55.880
Hana, take Pitz and hide!

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:56.760
Okay.

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:58.300
Let's go, Teppei!

00:17:58.300 --> 00:17:59.260
Roger.

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:15.070
This is Akari.

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:16.860
The Machine Goodfellows have appeared.

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:18.360
The captain and Teppei are intercepting them.

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:20.700
I'm tracking it here.

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:22.700
But there's no MM bus signal.

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:23.620
What's going on?

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:25.160
I don't know...

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:27.540
They may have some other goal.

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:29.250
Anyway, ready the Earth Engine.

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:30.830
The Nebula just arrived.

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:32.340
I'll send it, too.

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:33.340
Roger.

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:41.800
Earth Engine, Nebula Engine... Launch!

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:46.640
There are two Machine Goodfellows on radar.

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:48.190
Be very careful.

00:18:48.190 --> 00:18:48.810
Two?

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:55.860
I found the princess.

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:03.450
I can't hit him...

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:05.200
He's too fast!

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:10.170
Once it's tuned, the Neural
Maneuver System isn't so bad.

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:17.210
What?

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:19.720
They're here!

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:25.060
Earth...

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:26.010
Nebula, too!

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:40.320
Two against one isn't fair, but...

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:41.700
Let's go, Teppei!

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:42.740
Roger.

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:45.200
Okay, stop!

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:50.660
Move even a tiny bit, and I'll kill the princess.

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:54.210
I like it...

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:57.050
We look like a really evil bunch now!

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:00.130
Captain!

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:02.180
I said...

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:03.970
Don't move!

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:06.350
Daichi!

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:07.180
Teppei!

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:09.220
This is seriously bad...

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:16.020
You will regret your choice to give up eternal life, Albion!

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:25.160
Teppei!

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:41.720
For my sake... They're both going to...

00:20:58.940 --> 00:20:59.730
What?

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:10.410
This light... It can't be...

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:21.340
Orgone energy?

00:21:22.460 --> 00:21:23.550
What is that?

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:25.840
Hana?

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:29.350
The Blossom?!

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:37.270
How dare you hurt my friends?!

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:45.650
She's controlling the beam?

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:50.740
That Livlaster is already in ecdysis mode?

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:53.250
This is for Pitz!

00:21:59.330 --> 00:22:00.670
Amara!

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:03.760
We can't take any more of those Orgone beams!

00:22:04.760 --> 00:22:08.260
These guys never do let things get boring!

00:22:16.060 --> 00:22:17.440
Are you two okay?

00:22:22.230 --> 00:22:23.780
I'm okay...

00:22:24.440 --> 00:22:25.190
What about you, Teppei?

00:22:26.490 --> 00:22:27.950
I'm fine...

00:22:27.950 --> 00:22:29.160
What about Pitz?

00:22:30.820 --> 00:22:32.330
It's my fault.

00:22:33.580 --> 00:22:35.870
I'm sorry, Pitz.

00:22:37.410 --> 00:22:39.620
I'm sorry, everyone.

00:24:14.050 --> 00:24:17.760
The Planetary Gears use the awakened Seiren's powers

00:24:17.760 --> 00:24:20.520
to make new Orgone energy capsules.

00:24:21.560 --> 00:24:23.690
The Kill-T-Gang Aiatar attacks Earth.

00:24:24.770 --> 00:24:28.440
But the Midsummer's Knights advance their plans to a new stage, too.

00:24:29.440 --> 00:24:32.490
